# drawings made here are GPL-3.0-or-later.  The vendor's own files are in the
# tree because every claim this project makes about ALPHA's themes is a claim
# about those exact bytes - a reader should be able to hash them - and they are
# not licensed by anyone who has a right to license them.  The last paragraph
# says what was actually done to get them.

